 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "the-fairy-s-song-140405@major-2023-10-26",
   "gameId": "the-fairy-s-song-140405",
   "displayName": "Small update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-10-26T12:19:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "​Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm just writing a quick announcement to let you know I've uploaded a brand new build of ​The Fairy's Song​!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This new build fixes quite a lot of typos which were reported to me by a very kind reader, and I also fiddled with the options screen a bit. The old preference buttons were a bit janky, and they didn't always register mouseovers, but I think this has been fixed now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I didn't add anything too exciting to this build, but the game should be a little more polished now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, if you find any further issues, don't hesitate to let me know. I'll try to fix things in a reasonable timeframe!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Oh, and I'll also look into adding Steam trading cards to The Fairy's Song early next month. Trading cards have been enabled for the game for quite some time (over a year... orz), but I never got around to adding them. I'll try and rectify this soon, so you should be able to get some cute backgrounds and emotes of Marnie and Lisbeth soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ebi x",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
